-- Agent permissions in pipelines (src/features/agent-policies): the actions a
-- pipeline step may run and the agent events that may start a pipeline. The
-- definitions are the app's own (pipelineActionsFrom), so both lists agree.
-- Changes to agent permissions from a pipeline can only tighten; the RPCs
-- refuse anything wider (20261109171939_agent_policy_integrations.sql).

ON CONFLICT (operation) DO UPDATE SET definition = EXCLUDED.definition;
--> statement-breakpoint

ON CONFLICT DO NOTHING;
